","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boostera385-afk","id":291759050,"login":"boostera385-afk","node_id":"U_kgDOEWPjyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pastry-marketing/Marshmallow/commits/2ab36f34b2ef774847a726d0c35cf9500c48dad7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:06:06Z","email":"boostera385@gmail.com","name":"M.Kashif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:06:06Z","email":"boostera385@gmail.com","name":"M.Kashif"},"message":"feat: make urgent correction form-only and gate entry on resolving fixes\n\nPhase change: the urgent auto-correction no longer reads the QUO customer chat.\ncheck-urgent-lead now checks the lead''s form fields alone (spelling, grammar,\ncapitalization, formatting, city/state, service_type), so it produces one-click\nfixes for every lead rather than only ones with a matched chat. service_details\nand schedule fields remain un-editable (prompt + FIX_FIELDS + SQL whitelist).\n\nDialog now gates entry: each suggested fix must be Applied or Dismissed before\nMark Urgent is enabled. Also fixes a real bug — Apply now sends {field, old, new}\nas apply_urgent_form_fixes expects (it was sending current/suggested, so fixes\nnever applied). Missing details stay advisory flags; AI outage falls back to a\nrecorded acknowledgement so dispatch is never 