/avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/291759050?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boostera385-afk","id":291759050,"login":"boostera385-afk","node_id":"U_kgDOEWPjyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pastry-marketing/Marshmallow/commits/e165200aeea19a0526a6406085bf5d13a79c1b99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:30:47Z","email":"boostera385@gmail.com","name":"M.Kashif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:30:47Z","email":"boostera385@gmail.com","name":"M.Kashif"},"message":"Retry transient Apps Script mirror failures safely\n\nProduction requests showed intermittent Apps Script 404s, lock-busy responses, timeouts, and success responses without a processedOps acknowledgement, interspersed with fully successful batches. Retry idempotent mirror writes once and keep ambiguous acknowledgements queued with useful response-field diagnostics rather than incorrectly telling admins to redeploy.","tree":{"sha":"5a252cd25c342c895c216c0325b6579aa238a382","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pastry-marketing/Marshmallow/git/trees/5a252cd25c342c895c216c0325b6579aa238a382"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pastry-marketing/Marshmallow/git/commits/e165200aeea19a0526a6406085bf5d13a79c1b99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/291759050?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boostera385-afk","id":291759050,"login":"boostera385-afk","node_id":"U_kgDOEWPjyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pastry-marketing/Marshmallow/commit/e165200aeea19a0526a6406085bf5d13a79c1b99","node_id":"C_kwDORlXpldoAKGUxNjUyMDBhZWVhMTlhMDUyNmE2NDA2MDg1YmY1ZDEzYTc5YzFiOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pastry-marketing/Marshmallow/commit/9946d990f7fef147e602dea423a985f4b15855bc","sha":"9946d990f7fef147e602dea423a985f4b15855bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pastry-marketing/Marshmallow/commits/9946d990f7fef147e602dea423a985f4b15855bc"}],"sha":"e165200aeea19a0526a6406085bf5d13a79c1b99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pastry-marketing/Marshmallow/commits/e165200aeea19a0526a6406085bf5d13a79c1b99"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/291759050?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boostera385-afk","id":291759050,"login":"boostera385-afk","node_id":"U_kgDOEWPjyg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boostera385-afk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pastry-marketing/Marshmallow/commits/9946d990f7fef147e602dea423a985f4b15855bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:13:33Z","email":"boostera385@gmail.com","name":"M.Kashif"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:13:33Z","email":"boostera385@gmail.com","name":"M.Kashif"},"message":"Stop slow Apps Script cold starts from blocking a rebuild\n\nA live Web App answered three consecutive pings in 4.5s, 5.9s and 30.0s, so the fixed preflight budget was rejecting a mirror that is working. Give the ping 45s, trust a mirror that delivered within the last ten minutes, and widen the scheduled request so pg_net does not abandon a batch that is still writing.","tree":{"sha":"e73f3eb0c5d6920bdd119f378e6255ccd457420c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pastry-marketing/Marshmallow/git/trees/e73f3eb0c5d6920bdd119f378e6255ccd457420c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pastry-marketing/Marshmallow/git/commits/9946d990f7fef147e602dea423a985f4b15855bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"