 target (moves comments/attachments/time)\nAgent Groups: CRUD with member management, group selector in properties\nScenarios/Macros: saved action sets, execute on ticket (status/priority/assign/note)\nSpam: toggle is_spam flag from menu\nFavorites: star/unstar tickets per user\nShare: copy ticket link to clipboard\n\nBackend: 7 migrations, 4 new models, 4 new controllers, 4 new resources\nFrontend: 4 new API modules, full TicketDetailPage integration\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f72ea55c598dab09274a408d1a256623dc1bd105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucho19jose/ITSM-IA-FIRST/git/trees/f72ea55c598dab09274a408d1a256623dc1bd105"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucho19jose/ITSM-IA-FIRST/git/commits/debf62a0ca858a4b10ddb693cd10f1242dc882c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46167630?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucho19jose","id":46167630,"login":"lucho19jose","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MTY3NjMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lucho19jose/ITSM-IA-FIRST/commit/debf62a0ca858a4b10ddb693cd10f12