plete redesign matching Freshservice portal (solicitante, rich editor, file upload, KB suggestion)\n- Attachment system: display in ticket detail, preview modal (PDF/images/video with zoom/rotate/navigate), comment-level attachments\n- Notification bell: dropdown panel with notification list, mark-as-read, navigation to tickets\n- Echo/Pusher: graceful fallback when Reverb not configured (no more console errors)\n- Vite: added /storage proxy for file serving in dev\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57d25c7152b945d2b26cf85c746105223d59f1d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucho19jose/ITSM-IA-FIRST/git/trees/57d25c7152b945d2b26cf85c746105223d59f1d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucho19jose/ITSM-IA-FIRST/git/commits/652e802da3b925fbbcfd894df8ea2ab76b8f5670","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46167630?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucho19jose","id":46167630,"login":"lucho19jose","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MTY3NjMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho19jose","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lucho19jose/ITSM-IA-FIRST/commit/652e802da3b925fbb