,"email":"44731945+joyalrj22@users.noreply.github.com","name":"joyalrj22"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-12T21:12:20Z","committedDate":"2026-03-12T21:12:20Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:10:55.920Z","repositoryId":1180245950,"sha":"23fbee206eea48c0a0b3e2676ac93df790841924"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:10:55.920Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44731945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joyalrj22","id":44731945,"login":"joyalrj22","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NzMxOTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joyalrj22/ALeagueOfOurOwn/commits/504e8829b92f396c4030c172e77336344450a138/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:35:43Z","email":"44731945+joyalrj22@users.noreply.github.com","name":"joyalrj22"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:35:43Z","email":"44731945+joyalrj22@users.noreply.github.com","name":"joyalrj22"},"message":"Add AI-native tooling: security scanner, lint gate, Conductor + Linear tracking\n\n- scripts/ci/check-shell-patterns.sh: fetch-and-exec / reverse-shell pattern\n  scanner, wired into pre-commit and a new CI security-scan job.\n- .claude/settings.json + .cursorignore: deny coding-agent file-read access\n  to .env/keys/service-account JSON.\n- SECURITY.md: documents the above.\n- ESLint + Prettier for ui/, wired into CI as a Lint UI step.\n- .claude/skills/: stay-on-current-branch, local-ci-lint, skill-gap-review,\n  linear-issues -- repeatable procedures as flat markdown.\n- conductor/: Conductor methodology tracking work as Linear issues (team\n  ALE) + local plan.md execution files, including the Phase Completion\n  Verification and Checkpointing Protocol (human-gated pause per phase)\n  and an opt-in autonomous Stop-hook loop\n  (.claude/hooks/conductor-loop.sh, tested in\n  .claude/hooks/tests/conductor-loop.test.sh) with an iteration cap and\n  stall detection so it always terminates. Engine commands under\n  .claude/commands/conductor/: newTrack, implement, status, review,\n  revert, loop. Default implement_mode stays \"manual\".\n- mcp__Linear__* tool names (save_issue covers create+update, save_comment\n  not create_comment) and workspace states (Backlog/Todo/In Progress/Done/\n  Canceled -- no separate In Review) reflected throughout.\n- AGENTS.md: documents all of the above so an agent picking up this repo\n  finds it without being told.","tree":{"sha":"80d038c6f17d98b55761a953710d30c6bd6eb346","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joyalrj22/ALeagueOfOurOwn/git/trees/80d038c6f17d98b55761a953710d30c6bd6eb346"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joyalrj22/ALeagueOfOurOwn/git/commits/504e8829b92f396c4030c172e77336344450a138","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44731945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joyalrj22