o}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/commits/2dca61d0dae45f1b602c37a23ef61efd8a1602a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T05:11:03Z","email":"imran.siddique@opaque.co","name":"Imran Siddique"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T05:11:03Z","email":"imran.siddique@opaque.co","name":"Imran Siddique"},"message":"Fix CI: drop npm cache config, no lockfile is committed yet\n\nsetup-node''s cache: npm failed with ''Some specified paths were not resolved''\nbecause app/package-lock.json does not exist. Removed the cache config and\nnoted how to re-enable it. Also moved to Node 22.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"875c3bdf88520e4af28ee1ff2f1af7a07d351047","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/git/trees/875c3bdf88520e4af28ee1ff2f1af7a07d351047"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/git/commits/2dca61d0dae45f1b602c37a23ef61efd8a1602a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45405841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imran-siddique","id":45405841,"login":"imran-siddique","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDA1ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/commit/2dca61d0dae45f1b602c37a23ef61efd8a1602a9","node_id":"C_kwDORlo4M9oAKDJkY2E2MWQwZGFlNDVmMWI2MDJjMzdhMjNlZjYxZWZkOGExNjAyYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/commit/6c906dd58cf99aa5eb03a2df4f413b9cf58774f6","sha":"6c906dd58cf99aa5eb03a2df4f413b9cf58774f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/commits/6c906dd58cf99aa5eb03a2df4f413b9cf58774f6"}],"sha":"2dca61d0dae45f1b602c37a23ef61efd8a1602a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/commits/2dca61d0dae45f1b602c37a23ef61efd8a1602a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45405841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imran-siddique","id":45405841,"login":"imran-siddique","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDA1ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/commits/6c906dd58cf99aa5eb03a2df4f413b9cf58774f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T05:07:56Z","email":"imran.siddique@opaque.co","name":"Imran Siddique"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T05:08:51Z","email":"imran.siddique@opaque.co","name":"Imran Siddique"},"message":"Add the ShopFlow app at its Chapter 9 state, with a verifying test suite\n\nEstablishes the single-evolving-codebase shape under app/, starting with the\nChapter 9 caching layer and the tests that make the chapter''s claims executable.\n\napp/packages/cache\n  - cache-aside.ts with all four defences the chapter argues are mandatory:\n    single-flight, a cross-process herd lock, TTL jitter, negative caching\n  - invalidation-consumer.ts, the chapter''s listing built out, assuming\n    duplicate delivery / reordering / loss rather than hoping against them\n  - keys.ts so the Redis field-name contract lives in code, not convention\n  - redis-store.ts typed against a minimal client surface, so the cache never\n    takes a hard dependency on one Redis package\n  - ports.ts naming CacheStore / PurgeTarget, keeping the Redis -> CDN ->\n    origin-shield tiering explicit instead of scattered through the read path\n\nTests do not chase coverage. Each names a claim from the book and proves it, so\nchanging the implementation shows which argument breaks. npm test runs with no\ninfrastructure; the Redis integration suite skips itself unless REDIS_URL is set.\n\nAlso adds CI (unit + a real-Redis integration job), docker-compose for the\nChapter 9 infrastructure, the relational schema with the version column that\nmakes invalidation safe, and ch9/README.md tying the chapter to the code.\n\nNo chapter tag yet: an evolving codebase has to be built in chapter order for\na ch9-cached tag to point at a history that ever contained Ch1-Ch8.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b3e94585897a672a2b18309d56d2a219ce61393","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/git/trees/1b3e94585897a672a2b18309d56d2a219ce61393"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/git/commits/6c906dd58cf99aa5eb03a2df4f413b9cf58774f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45405841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imran-siddique","id":45405841,"login":"imran-siddique","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDA1ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/commit/6c906dd58cf99aa5eb03a2df4f413b9cf58774f6","node_id":"C_kwDORlo4M9oAKDZjOTA2ZGQ1OGNmOTlhYTVlYjAzYTJkZjRmNDEzYjljZjU4Nzc0ZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/commit/d8d4e08044c56c7f2cfaebc9d06688c73c016593","sha":"d8d4e08044c56c7f2cfaebc9d06688c73c016593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/commits/d8d4e08044c56c7f2cfaebc9d06688c73c016593"}],"sha":"6c906dd58cf99aa5eb03a2df4f413b9cf58774f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/commits/6c906dd58cf99aa5eb03a2df4f413b9cf58774f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45405841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imran-siddique","id":45405841,"login":"imran-siddique","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDA1ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/commits/0ae47c76efa4b0f358fdcb19d41c8dba7bc9a1ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T04:56:15Z","email":"imran.siddique@opaque.co","name":"Imran Siddique"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T04:56:15Z","email":"imran.siddique@opaque.co","name":"Imran Siddique"},"message":"Add all 73 Architect''s Prompts, one file per chapter\n\nExtracts every Architect''s Prompt from the 16 chapter manuscripts verbatim and\npublishes them as chN/prompts.md, each with the \"When to use this\" line that\ntells the reader the moment it applies.\n\n- 73 prompts across 16 chapters (Ch1 has 2, Ch2 3, Ch3 4, Ch4 4, Ch5-16 5 each)\n- Per-chapter table of contents linking to each prompt\n- PROMPTS.md root index across the whole book\n- README rewritten with the chapter map, the layout convention, and the stack\n  the book commits to, so code samples and extended notes have a place to land\n\nThree different body conventions exist in the manuscripts (Ch1/Ch2 store the\nprompt as one quote-wrapped run, Ch3 as plain paragraphs, Ch4-16 as code-styled\nblocks with internal blank lines). All three are normalized here without\naltering a word of the prompt text.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7a705dc85a45eda1276d06267787be421258fc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/git/trees/d7a705dc85a45eda1276d06267787be421258fc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/git/commits/0ae47c76efa4b0f358fdcb19d41c8dba7bc9a1ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45405841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imran-siddique","id":45405841,"login":"imran-siddique","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDA1ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imran-siddique","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/imran-siddique/Architecting-at-Scale/commit/0ae47c76ef