ashank-vritti/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/vritti-core/commits/59b4a35c1498cdeec1a43c337a2b3839301d8290/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:55:39Z","email":"shashank@vrittiai.com","name":"Shashank Raju"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:55:39Z","email":"shashank@vrittiai.com","name":"Shashank Raju"},"message":"feat(graphql): refactor catalog channels queries to use fragments for listing fields\n\n- Introduced a new fragment `ListingFields` to standardize the fields returned in catalog listings.\n- Updated `CATALOG_LISTINGS_QUERY`, `CATALOG_LISTING_QUERY`, `LE_CATALOG_LISTINGS_QUERY`, `LE_CATALOG_LISTING_QUERY`, `SITE_CATALOG_LISTINGS_QUERY`, and `SITE_CATALOG_LISTING_QUERY` to utilize the new fragment.\n- Simplified the structure of the queries to improve readability and maintainability.\n\nfeat(graphql): add site offering variants query\n\n- Created a new query `SITE_OFFERING_VARIANTS_QUERY` to fetch offering variants for a storefront.\n- This query allows for searching and excluding specific variant IDs, enhancing the flexibility of product page management.\n\nrefactor(core): reorganize exports in index.ts for better clarity\n\n- Updated exports in `index.ts` to group related types and operations, improving the structure and readability of the module exports.\n\nfix(server): integrate offerings operations into SDK\n\n- Added `createOfferingsOperations` to the SDK to support offerings functionality in the server-side implementation.","tree":{"sha":"f8acc8fe29dc05abf711