l":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/vritti-core/commits/81e044cc2eb39b9822c06f14fc35c6474855dd85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:30:56Z","email":"shashank@vrittiai.com","name":"Shashank Raju"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:30:56Z","email":"shashank@vrittiai.com","name":"Shashank Raju"},"message":"Refactor catalog channel hooks and services\n\n- Removed obsolete hooks: useCreateAppChannel, useCreateB2bChannel, useCreatePosChannel, useUpdateChannel from legal-entity, organization, and site directories.\n- Introduced new hook: useUpsertChannel to handle both creation and updating of channels.\n- Updated useDeleteChannel and useSetChannelItemVisibility hooks to use CATALOG_CHANNELS_KEY instead of CHANNELS_SCREEN_KEY for query invalidation.\n- Added useCatalogChannels hook to fetch catalog channels using useSuspenseQuery.\n- Updated service methods to consolidate channel creation and updating into a single upsertChannel method.\n- Refactored types in schemas to improve clarity and consistency, renaming ChannelScreenEntryData to ChannelEntryData and adjusting related interfaces.","tree":{"sha":"d8d1486f80a8f1de55850a806f2d4a3ed775f83a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/vritti-core/git/trees/d8d1486f80a8f1de55850a806f2d4a3ed775f83a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/vritti-core/git/commits/81e044cc2eb39b9822c06f14fc35c6474855dd85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220210489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashank-vritti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/u