ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/vritti-core/commits/8a1dcf4df2bb28432234f6599d60d276f68fb59d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:52:50Z","email":"shyamsunder.mittapally@gmail.com","name":"Shyam sunder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:52:50Z","email":"shyamsunder.mittapally@gmail.com","name":"Shyam sunder"},"message":"feat(shopper): add GraphQL queries and mutations for shopper profile and addresses\n\n- Introduced CART_QUANTITIES_QUERY to fetch product quantities in the cart.\n- Added WISHLIST_VARIANT_IDS_QUERY to retrieve saved product IDs.\n- Created ShopperProfileFieldsFragment for reusable shopper profile fields.\n- Implemented SHOPPER_PROFILE_QUERY to get the signed-in shopper''s profile.\n- Added UPDATE_SHOPPER_PROFILE mutation for updating shopper details.\n- Defined ShopperAddressFieldsFragment for address-related fields.\n- Implemented SHOPPER_ADDRESSES_QUERY to fetch the shopper''s address book.\n- Added mutations for adding, updating, and removing shopper addresses.\n\nfeat(shopper): extend core index with new types\n\n- Added types for CartQuantity, ShopperAddress, ShopperAddressInput, ShopperProfile, and ShopperProfileInput to the core index.\n\nfeat(address): create GraphQL types for shopper addresses\n\n- Defined ShopperAddress and ShopperAddressInput types for address management.\n- Implemented UpdateShopperAddressInput for editing addresses.\n- Created ShopperAddressRefInput for removing addresses.","tree":{"sha":"3e7251144b5b201c6c3bbf9332a08ae4a264d1ef","url":"https://api.github.co