list schemas and operations\n\n- Introduced new Money and CatalogListing types in GraphQL schema.\n- Updated CartItem and Cart types to include new fields and removed deprecated ones.\n- Modified CartDetailDto and CartTableRow to ensure partyName is non-nullable.\n- Enhanced CartsDomainRepository to decode bigint values correctly for amount fields.\n- Updated CatalogChannelsDomainRepository to remove unnecessary legalEntityId and siteId filters.\n- Refactored wishlist repository to handle bigint decoding for amount fields.\n- Improved CartDetailPage and CartsPage components to ensure partyName is always displayed.\n- Removed unnecessary partyId checks in ItemsTab component.\n- Updated site description in carts feature for clarity.\n- Cleaned up commerce-permissions by removing unused storefront catalog permissions.\n- Enhanced vap-sdk to support new catalog listing queries for legal entities and sites.\n- Updated types and context handling in vap-sdk to support workspace scopes.","tree":{"sha":"4c1a58243bc793c49d2e6da0891a4eca24ddd90b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/vritti-core/git/trees/4c1a58243bc793c49d2e6da0891a4eca24ddd90b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/vritti-core/git/commits/7cfbb4db683719c6bbaf34736fe40fa0819fc834","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125557277?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyamsunder99","id":125557277,"login":"shyamsunder99","node_id":"U_kgDOB3vaHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/orgs","received_events_