}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamsunder99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/vritti-core/commits/c72b82b128a8cb0b5d88dd2b3c7a6a6b50a5e676/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:54:02Z","email":"shyamsunder.mittapally@gmail.com","name":"Shyam sunder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:54:02Z","email":"shyamsunder.mittapally@gmail.com","name":"Shyam sunder"},"message":"Refactor and reorganize code structure\n\n- Moved `isStaff` import from `globals/pageFields` to `lib/fields` in Media and Users collections.\n- Deleted `SiteSettings.ts` and `pageFields.ts` globals as they are no longer needed.\n- Updated `livePreview` logic to remove references to `site-settings`.\n- Adjusted `media.ts` comments for clarity regarding type imports.\n- Removed `site.ts` as it is no longer necessary.\n- Enhanced migration documentation for clarity on generated files and schema handling.\n- Updated `payload.config.ts` to remove `SiteSettings` global and use a constant for schema name.\n- Introduced `DEFAULT_ENVIRONMENT` constant in `infisical.ts` for better environment management.\n- Refactored `writeInfisicalLink` to use `DEFAULT_ENVIRONMENT`.\n- Added `ensure-schema.mjs` script to automate schema creation in migrations.\n- Created new `fields.ts` file to centralize field helpers and access functions.\n- Introduced `schema.ts` to define and validate the database schema name.","tree":{"sha":"8952e46dc809e49bf1871b58b252632c8b6d35c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/vritti-core/git/trees/8952e46dc809e49bf1871b58b252632c8b6d35c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vritti-ai-platforms/vritti-core/git/commits/c72b82b128a8cb0b5d88dd2b3c7a6a6b50a5e676","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url