},"html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67/fk-encore/commit/ee182de96a5f69a6cfb1b99e2da6f2a532ea6bfe","node_id":"C_kwDORl_MVtoAKGVlMTgyZGU5NmE1ZjY5YTZjZmIxYjk5ZTJkYTZmMmE1MzJlYTZiZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67/fk-encore/commit/8a45835d6ae04dea233206ad6d2526e5700b33ba","sha":"8a45835d6ae04dea233206ad6d2526e5700b33ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/8a45835d6ae04dea233206ad6d2526e5700b33ba"}],"sha":"ee182de96a5f69a6cfb1b99e2da6f2a532ea6bfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/ee182de96a5f69a6cfb1b99e2da6f2a532ea6bfe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2434239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67","id":2434239,"login":"as19git67","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzQyMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/8a45835d6ae04dea233206ad6d2526e5700b33ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T21:26:39Z","email":"anton@schegg.de","name":"as19git67"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T21:26:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Trip planner: a Google Maps app short link resolves to a place again (#1470)\n\nA maps.app.goo.gl/…?g_st=ic link out of the Google Maps app does not\nlead to a pin: its first redirect is maps.google.com/?q=Name, Address\n&ftid=…, the place in words beside an id only Google reads, and no\ncoordinate. The server followed one hop, found no coordinate and\nreported the link as unresolved; the share extension then dropped the\nname as well, showed nothing, and did not offer \"Meine Ideen\", which\nneeds a coordinate.\n\n- map-link.ts: Google''s `q=` gives a `name` (its first part) and a\n  `query` (the whole term); consent.google.com is unwrapped to its\n  `continue` target.\n- map-link-read.ts: followShortLink follows up to four hops until one\n  names a coordinate, keeping the words read on the way; the reader\n  returns `query`. share.ts uses the same follower and resolves a\n  name-only link in the trip''s regions like an article''s names.\n- Share extension: with no coordinate but a name, the place is searched\n  in Apple Maps (MKLocalSearch), shown as \"Gefunden: Name · Adresse\",\n  and the collection is offered; the title is filled from the name.\n\nBuild 1791.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WSkPd5rVvryfTqbafCwo2n\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc7f0e091af30fa50a07a19a4c428b8eb7cf04c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/trees/fc7f0e091af30fa50a07a19a4c428b8eb7cf04c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/commits/8a45835d6ae04dea233206ad6d2526e5700b33ba","verification":{"payload":"tree fc7f0e091af30fa50a07a19a4c428b8eb7cf04c6\nparent e53786746446ee6bc1dac2e1f33b31bd4eff62b1\nauthor as19git67 <anton@schegg.de> 1791408399 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791408399 +0200\n\nTrip planner: a Google Maps app short link resolves to a place again (#1470)\n\nA maps.app.goo.gl/…?g_st=ic link out of the Google Maps app does not\nlead to a pin: its first redirect is maps.google.com/?q=Name, Address\n&ftid=…, the place in words beside an id only Google reads, and no\ncoordinate. The server followed one hop, found no coordinate and\nreported the link as unresolved; the share extension then dropped the\nname as well, showed nothing, and did not offer \"Meine Ideen\", which\nneeds a coordinate.\n\n- map-link.ts: Google''s `q=` gives a `name` (its first part) and a\n  `query` (the whole term); consent.google.com is unwrapped to its\n  `continue` target.\n- map-link-read.ts: followShortLink follows up to four hops until one\n  names a coordinate, keeping the words read on the way; the reader\n  returns `query`. share.ts uses the same follower and resolves a\n  name-only link in the trip''s regions like an article''s names.\n- Share extension: with no coordinate but a name, the place is searched\n  in Apple Maps (MKLocalSearch), shown as \"Gefunden: Name · Adresse\",\n  and the collection is offered; the title is filled from the name.\n\nBuild 1791.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WSkPd5rVvryfTqbafCwo2n\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxrkPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3ioQABjIbm4bWGwq9iSe0wWFB16+\n6XMjucTNfBJBR0/sFbYRX8m4lCjmKcv9PF3Qvs3CMRcVij7uWxcyl2Y6ownxNaQB\nsyOloJNEo3D11tcCi1xFdFY7bW6r3I2cOduh7Z8iGH4naPAHNIqH3LHQ3xb8Z3Ks\na9GXX6HJ2bERoIRUcopvuFzsV6POMI5CsFpxqi0Mo8T7P9mSiMNru8kETjyldLIN\nJJ2CvsfH3ueaLSpm4j84y0dLVnFIeREUxCzJeLbQaCRht1d3I2E/rRvRQ9sEjttV\nt6rbtGT9Y/JBviQTYlQ8ZsNTPQRCrOoCiwxM4Y7So95doHn//T6Hy2hkTmbXqjsO\nSJQ7DAqgwi+53oeH1lE+UShYn1Mzo1KTlkLYKzB0+l96ge/yCsNiQMKmfEqau5fM\nC4pP9zJBgx4VL/DtaLka8LJ3PLuoj4gN8WeqLXkcawExDEh7TshfYYvl/YPSyG++\nm3iLGQEqfPllR638uXdMzZfe9aPjwgx1OrJwQgMtoFbfIZOPAbBoSD4wpVivL4BQ\nIThOLAhrEztC0gnHHo/cBGT4EelJRk5mmX/p0zQoEuHxBJlJmdeM4P/HTdDuyUA6\nE1Hq+iZlzG1g9qrOpM0dU+EJ/xOKKgITGHtT4mxOfdTyLt38DJMZrdOZAgN6761h\n0pax72mhesYL4qv0Uz1Q\n=rc5r\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T21:26:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co