":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:29:28Z","email":"anton@schegg.de","name":"as19git67"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:29:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Finance: quotes page (stage 2) and the Yahoo consent session (#1468)\n\n* Finance: quotes page with a tile per held security\n\nStage 2 of the quotes page (.claude/plans/kurse.md): one tile per\nsecurity the depots hold, with the last price, its change over the\nchosen range, a sparkline, and the shares'' value; a total of the scope\nabove the tiles. The range (1D · 1W · 1M · 1Y · Max) is the toolbar''s\nview switch and lives in the URL, the depot scope in the filter panel.\nThe page polls every minute while visible and keeps the previous tiles\non screen while a reload is in flight; a refresh button fetches at once.\nA tile links to the position page.\n\nEntry \"Kurse\" in the finance menu; a story with invented securities.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n* Yahoo quotes: open a session with the consent cookie and crumb\n\nYahoo answers the search endpoint with 429 unless the request carries\nits consent cookie and the crumb that belongs to it, whatever the\nrequest rate. The very first tick was therefore refused at the first\nsecurity and ended as \"rate limited\".\n\nThe adapter now fetches the cookie from fc.yahoo.com and the crumb from\ngetcrumb once an hour, sends both with every request, renews the\nsession once when a request is refused, and reports a rate limit only\nwhen the fresh session is refused too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2094d3ad9b971391dc06273ba1aa11c670af88fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/trees/2094d3ad9b971391dc06273ba1aa11c670af88fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/commits/2fe31f767e135ccfda0ca5aeff67655061ce4ec3","verification":{"payload":"tree 2094d3ad9b971391dc06273ba1aa11c670af88fa\nparent bc3215101a1806c0b70ea63503d270acbbd1ccad\nauthor as19git67 <anton@schegg.de> 1791404968 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791404968 +0200\n\nFinance: quotes page (stage 2) and the Yahoo consent session (#1468)\n\n* Finance: quotes page with a tile per held security\n\nStage 2 of the quotes page (.claude/plans/kurse.md): one tile per\nsecurity the depots hold, with the last price, its change over the\nchosen range, a sparkline, and the shares'' value; a total of the scope\nabove the tiles. The range (1D · 1W · 1M · 1Y · Max) is the toolbar''s\nview switch and lives in the URL, the depot scope in the filter panel.\nThe page polls every minute while visible and keeps the previous tiles\non screen while a reload is in flight; a refresh button fetches at once.\nA tile links to the position page.\n\nEntry \"Kurse\" in the finance menu; a story with invented securities.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n* Yahoo quotes: open a session with the consent cookie and crumb\n\nYahoo answers the search endpoint with 429 unless the request carries\nits consent cookie and the crumb that belongs to it, whatever the\nrequest rate. The very first tick was therefore refused at the first\nsecurity and ended as \"rate limited\".\n\nThe adapter now fetches the cookie from fc.yahoo.com and the crumb from\ngetcrumb once an hour, sends both with every request, renews the\nsession once when a request is refused, and reports a rate limit only\nwhen the fresh session is refused too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","sig