FjZTRlYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67/fk-encore/commit/bc3215101a1806c0b70ea63503d270acbbd1ccad","sha":"bc3215101a1806c0b70ea63503d270acbbd1ccad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/bc3215101a1806c0b70ea63503d270acbbd1ccad"}],"sha":"2fe31f767e135ccfda0ca5aeff67655061ce4ec3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/2fe31f767e135ccfda0ca5aeff67655061ce4ec3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2434239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67","id":2434239,"login":"as19git67","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzQyMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/bc3215101a1806c0b70ea63503d270acbbd1ccad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:29:30Z","email":"anton@schegg.de","name":"as19git67"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:29:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Finance: quotes of held securities — provider, Yahoo adapter, cache and scheduler (stage 1) (#1467)\n\n* Finance: tables for the quotes of held securities\n\nfinance_quote_symbol keeps the provider''s symbol per position, resolved\nonce from ISIN or WKN; finance_quote keeps the prices fetched for it —\nthe day''s minutes for a month, the closes for good — so the history\noutlives the provider.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n* Finance: quote provider, Yahoo adapter, quote cache and scheduler\n\nStage 1 of the quotes page (.claude/plans/kurse.md).\n\n- quote-provider.ts: the interface (resolve a security to the provider''s\n  symbol, fetch its history) with a replaceable instance, so tests answer\n  from memory and never reach the network.\n- quote-provider-yahoo.ts: Yahoo''s search and chart endpoints; a German\n  listing is preferred, a 429 ends the tick.\n- quotes.ts: the held securities from the latest snapshot of each depot;\n  refreshQuotes resolves once, backfills five years of closes once, then\n  fetches the day''s minutes on every run and the closes when a day old;\n  a day''s running bar is written over, a minute''s price is final.\n  GET /finance/quotes?range= serves one tile per security with the last\n  price, value, change over the range and a thinned series;\n  POST /finance/quotes/refresh fetches at once.\n- quotes-cron.ts: every five minutes while German markets trade, hourly\n  otherwise, a quarter hour of backoff after a rate limit.\n- portfolio.ts exports visibleDepots and latestHoldings for reuse.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7fb96dab022cbfe7861c281ac005804684285666","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/trees/7fb96dab022cbfe7861c281ac005804684285666"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/commits/bc3215101a1806c0b70ea63503d270acbbd1ccad","verification":{"payload":"tree 7fb96dab022cbfe7861c281ac005804684285666\nparent 62e30d22a2075dd038d9114c5cc91da530b1973c\nauthor as19git67 <anton@schegg.de> 1791390570 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791390570 +0200\n\nFinance: quotes of held securities — provider, Yahoo adapter, cache and scheduler (stage 1) (#1467)\n\n* Finance: tables for the quotes of held securities\n\nfinance_quote_symbol keeps the provider''s symbol per position, resolved\nonce from ISIN or WKN; finance_quote keeps the prices fetched for it —\nthe day''s minutes for a month, the closes for good — so the history\noutlives the provider.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n* Finance: quote provider, Yahoo adapter, quote cache and scheduler\n\nStage 1 of the quotes page (.claude/plans/kurse.md).\n\n- quote-provider.ts: the interface (resolve a security to the provider''s\n  symbol, fetch its history) with a replaceable instance, so tests answer\n  from memory and never reach the network.\n- quote-provider-yahoo.ts: Yahoo''s search and chart endpoints; a German\n  listing is preferred, a 429 ends the tick.\n- quotes.ts: the held securities from the latest snapshot of each depot;\n  refreshQuotes resolves once, backfills five years of closes once, then\n  fetches the day''s minutes on every run and the closes when a day old;\n  a day''s running bar is written over, a minute''s price is final.\n  GET /finance/quotes?range= serves one tile per security with the last\n  price, value, change over the range and a thinned series;\n  POST /finance/quotes/refresh fetches at once.\n- quotes-cron.ts: every five minutes while German markets trade, hourly\n  otherwise, a quarter hour of backoff after a rate limit.\n- portfolio.ts exports visibleDepots and latestHoldings for reuse.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABC