y@github.com> 1791353846 +0200\n\nForecast: widen the target age field so its placeholder and value show (#1463)\n\nThe stacked arrows sit inside the 4.5rem field and left room for one letter,\nso \"Alter\" showed as \"A\". At 7.5rem the placeholder and a two-digit age fit\nbeside the arrows.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TzUSmLtnpEakztrMexTZWZ\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxeP2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5ZYQAJ7Fk0FtLRCHSqUfYiw60YQw\nBuYxZ86qvWHvKG2OPhMM2v5qashl2W97AcuuhtpScm+Sn8tmCZGj07YgLMe/XkUj\nKLbVSSaMa/NdfEteFjkjrfXD63aip5MTjdGC0qFHUeEMX9rkB+jOU6MW830FAJGi\nJRmVOe2aDGLVxsGp5Emj+VMEcZn0rgkRVPsYD0i7uf7Y6J2BihAOtQ5ChPURMSqf\n5CQhBacm91dMf8uueIG9rxLw8NMEJZYGd6a/KSWNKBTEJ1qM9Uxrzh0WYb3JOqQ0\nVMgDKlaP2PvJcwD/ArvZv4XEQH7YeD0ImDz9SR8AYAUo2GJl2pcVXZcugZ3rjq1O\nOhv+3c2GIKG9NIiIr8PG8EtqZ+162vtK2wlZy9tW1BKLD6oSy7RufD0U0McgLrJ1\n+Iwwolz9o9Ydff2eorjW6B/gHCE8G7GlHkKBvYfYQIl8asiYnRvbFZu9q5HdEK+M\nC58hT3OYs3Kb4YmXjfwtp10QL+zpklcbdBKEuBVVUwSJHUgpuWVIc1hrTrBIPw14\nnlmUzJi8eHneCQ3JZLXs/nmM+5d/7wj/CYBDzP5cXCmNUylNIYVr9Knm0E5C9Aby\nWwXDmrOpAX91fBMgwIZ5rpT7nl9IpRhca1+QGPwF31NU0NlCt442ZxuEATey0SKz\nMFnNzj02403bBEuaUWVH\n=7acH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T06:17:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67/fk-encore/commit/fa3a4fe48b76417bff126efa44116f4aa0015166","node_id":"C_kwDORl_MVtoAKGZhM2E0ZmU0OGI3NjQxN2JmZjEyNmVmYTQ0MTE2ZjRhYTAwMTUxNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67/fk-encore/commit/1ed70dcbfe41b2684851493a9c3996c325f762da","sha":"1ed70dcbfe41b2684851493a9c3996c325f762da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/1ed70dcbfe41b2684851493a9c3996c325f762da"}],"sha":"fa3a4fe48b76417bff126efa44116f4aa0015166","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/fa3a4fe48b76417bff126efa44116f4aa0015166"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2434239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67","id":2434239,"login":"as19git67","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzQyMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/1ed70dcbfe41b2684851493a9c3996c325f762da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:17:24Z","email":"anton@schegg.de","name":"as19git67"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:17:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Portfolio review: reload after the statement dialog asked the model (#1462)\n\nThe review judges statements by a dry run that only uses stored model\nanswers. A statement without one is read by the rules alone; when they\nmisread the net, it is listed as a conflict. Opening it in the dialog\nasks the model and stores the answer, and the dialog then shows the\nfigures adding up, but the list kept the stale conflict.\n\nThe dialog now emits `read` when it asked the model for the first time,\nand the review reloads once the dialog closes.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95c0f6b138f13a209e690217c77882f972139233","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/trees/95c0f6b138f13a209e690217c77882f972139233"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/commits/1ed70dcbfe41b2684851493a9c3996c325f762da","verification":{"payload":"tree 95c0f6b138f13a209e690217c77882f972139233\nparent 0e8a16c12983a3217823db277f7c9e68ad21d30a\nauthor as19git67 <anton@schegg.de> 1791353844 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791353844 +0200\n\nPortfolio review: reload after the statement dialog asked the model (#1462)\n\nThe review judges statements by a dry run that only uses stored model\nanswers. A statement without one is read by the rules alone; when they\nmisread the net, it is listed as a conflict. Opening it in the dialog\nasks the model and stores the answer, and the dialog then shows the\nfigures adding up, but the list kept the stale conflict.\n\nThe dialog now emits `read` when it asked the model for the first time,\nand the review reloads once the dialog closes.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxeP0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA48cQAIrHP3mV2hRnDrtt6VpMBDNq\nJGYQCFOW+6JdZvheXDWTvXA4xht+QbR9c5DrwoHbLf76hTeWmZ5Ffe/BRU+k3+dm\ns3S4Uu19dexqkS56vkZcr8ZW2IcFy8txPciwWYcNHcn5mAsDvRPdlLIZfV528rv2\nWkVMSgb9Y6yCUEGKq+1GeQ9jElKiUjWOl+/b+TjyHRu7wgGFX9z+LlU9ZzjvKcGq\nhAwQBLNAXVhqa22ssafYRw4FZT+jZ8vEID41nx6quKausCz69lMwdAVzstUU2DIZ\noNm7yQu5B96n1JCcg5oNP6IHsGcJXjzA1xEt1LkolMAH/LxRoD3QOLEpFT6WQeUm\nWSoP6dpleDIqEeenyiMs3pdf1ovVLO57hLhSWrnhU8My8IAoIpKxpYWFYmUyWdjk\nfVjL0a6QKdmBGZLRmlmUif8EqrVxrC0hwFFYCJzXajxeAdAvZovvyAfRFb76d0P7\nsGHlqB2143KyVGUF+L6d4vGvtM/lHEVm5zGh4o1cFpVkfMkPqzKgb2oYbaQtiHA8\nkox4VjzVzg0TZAB5Vil1HEQwz9OVDMhmpOwn6EskRk1L26hnfK0VT5Va9Y2G4v1t\nCBF2Vg+6z8kl5yg8eGrUH38n5O2hdtR12cmQZ7OQAmK1wF58iaigUba6CmsMqc3Y\nwN5uktOwDykns9SrZSry\n=sQ12\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T06:17:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67/fk-encore/commit/1ed70dcbfe41b2684851493a9c3996c325f762da","node_id":"C_kwDORl_MVtoAKDFlZDcwZGNiZmU0MWIyNjg0ODUxNDkzYTljMzk5NmMzMjVmNzYyZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67/fk-encore/commit/0e8a16c12983a3217823db277f7c9e68ad21d30a","sha":"0e8a16c12983a3217823db277f7c9e68ad21d30a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/0e8a16c12983a3217823db277f7c9e68ad21d30a"}],"sha":"1ed70dcbfe41b2684851493a9c3996c325f762da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/1ed70dcbfe41b2684851493a9c3996c325f762da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2434239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67","id":2434239,"login":"as19git67","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzQyMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/0e8a16c12983a3217823db277f7c9e68ad21d30a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:30:30Z","email":"anton@schegg.de","name":"as19git67"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:30:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Portfolio: same-day round trips, buy fees in the cost, and two settlement misreadings (#1461)\n\n* Settlement parser: a spaced \"Wertpapier Abrechnung\" is a trade; no account numbers as amounts\n\n- Some banks head a trade \"Wertpapier Abrechnung Verkauf\" with a space.\n  The trade pattern missed it, so a sale whose tax part mentions the\n  Vorabpauschale was read as a notice of accumulated income and booked\n  as a tax charge.\n- \"zu Gunsten des Kontos <number>\" no longer serves as the label of the\n  net, and a run of more than seven digits without separators is not an\n  amount: an account number was read as tax and net.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n* Portfolio: buys before sales within a day; buy fees count as cost\n\n- The realized walk ordered rows of one day by id. A sale read from a\n  document before the same day''s buy was derived from the booking got the\n  lower id, sold from an empty inventory at no cost, and left the buy''s\n  shares in the inventory to lower the cost of every later sale. Within\n  a day, buys and transfers in now come first.\n- A buy''s cost is what was paid with its fees (the tax office counts\n  them as acquisition cost), else quantity × price. This applies to the\n  realized walk and to both WAC indexes behind the open cost basis, so a\n  buy with an amount paid and a quantity no longer needs a price.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b30649c322088b19d666f94d74bfd987dee151f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/trees/b30649c322088b19d666f94d74bfd987dee151f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/commits/0e8a16c12983a3217823db277f7c9e68ad21d30a","verification":{"payload":"tree b30649c322088b19d666f94d74bfd987dee151f9\nparent 514c8456077830d42a1d521c34748a05ddec15ef\nauthor as19git67 <anton@schegg.de> 1791322230 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791322230 +0200\n\nPortfolio: same-day round trips, buy fees in the cost, and two settlement misreadings (#1461)\n\n* Settlement parser: a spaced \"Wertpapier Abrechnung\" is a trade; no account numbers as amounts\n\n- Some banks head a trade \"Wertpapier Abrechnung Verkauf\" with a space.\n  The trade pattern missed it, so a sale whose tax part mentions the\n  Vorabpauschale was read as a notice of accumulated income and booked\n  as a tax charge.\n- \"zu Gunsten des Kontos <number>\" no longer serves as the label of the\n  net, and a run of more than seven digits without separators is not an\n  amount: an account number was read as tax and net.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n* Portfolio: buys before sales within a day; buy fees count as cost\n\n- The realized walk ordered rows of one day by id. A sale read from a\n  document before the same day''s buy was derived from the booking got the\n  lower id, sold from an empty inventory at no cost, and left the buy''s\n  shares in the inventory to lower the cost of every later sale. Within\n  a day, buys and transfers in now come first.\n- A buy''s cost is what was paid with its fees (the tax office counts\n  them as acquisition cost), else quantity × price. This applies to the\n  realized walk and to both WAC indexes behind the open cost basis, so a\n  buy with an amount paid and a quantity no longer needs a price.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxWh2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASz0QAGsHhdccVVUz5HCuv2YqwJlh\nmRADzR8qLn2ZAtimuCscvsb+vWc4NY6YGayjCnUqbdjubEmKzjGaLcq5lzJEhPtG\nMYBevpgsV0bTsug80lcDmemkDukztIJzvuNztYZjaJasnJN+VslZgIqU7Xx7kH98\nM9HXfSk0rEOFNuDiLFmE7lNTqKG39O1yP+7wQpfBsXdqA0tAHUUoZfRbs3yqnC2c\nmTXdv7SAlViea+z2speVHaJz/rGanR7I1uu3rfb8Y/t/OcTrnzOGJ1iMaW+qjlql\