ml_url":"https://github.com/as19git67/fk-encore/commit/981ee1f844c3c05770fcf1cd7d74fcd708c00c86","sha":"981ee1f844c3c05770fcf1cd7d74fcd708c00c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/981ee1f844c3c05770fcf1cd7d74fcd708c00c86"}],"sha":"fc4f595cba057b620336eee4abc02c568d046630","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/fc4f595cba057b620336eee4abc02c568d046630"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2434239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67","id":2434239,"login":"as19git67","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzQyMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/981ee1f844c3c05770fcf1cd7d74fcd708c00c86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:36:04Z","email":"anton@schegg.de","name":"as19git67"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:36:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Settlement names: read the identifier line, and let the text decide between rules and model (#1453)\n\n* Settlement names: read the identifier line, and let the text decide between rules and model\n\nOn tax statements the rules regularly named the security wrong and the\nmodel''s right name was ignored:\n\n- The name stands on the identifier line, between the quantity and the\n  identifiers (\"Stk. 25 ALPHA INDUSTRIES AG , WKN / ISIN: …\"); the\n  rules only looked above or below that line or after a label, and a\n  bare \"Wertpapier\" heads unrelated lines in the tax tables. The\n  identifier line is now read first.\n- No check reaches the name, so a disagreement went to the rules. Now the\n  text decides: the name printed nearer the ISIN/WKN wins; one the text\n  does not print at all loses; a tie stays with the rules.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n* Settlement reading: exchange fees after the fees'' total; no model Kurswert on tax papers\n\n- Variable Börsenspesen (and other third-party charges) printed after\n  the bank''s \"Summe Entgelte\" were left out of the fees, so a settlement\n  that showed them did not add up by exactly that amount and read as\n  unverified. Charges listed after the total are now added to it, and\n  \"(Variable) Börsenspesen\" counts as a fee line without a total too.\n- A tax statement or a notice of accumulated income prints no Kurswert,\n  price or charges. What the model reads there (a tax base, a per-share\n  amount) filled the gap and failed the equation check; it is dropped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14ae31a55bdbf352294d594cdf895fc3c4744555","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/trees/14ae31a55bdbf352294d594cdf895fc3c4744555"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/commits/981ee1f844c3c05770fcf1cd7d74fcd708c00c86","verification":{"payload":"tree 14ae31a55bdbf352294d594cdf895fc3c4744555\nparent 54c2575f70dcff02120a41e5f7f2e16decfc12ec\nauthor as19git67 <anton@schegg.de> 1791218164 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791218164 +0200\n\nSettlement names: read the identifier line, and let the text decide between rules and model (#1453)\n\n* Settlement names: read the identifier line, and let the text decide between rules and model\n\nOn tax statements the rules regularly named the security wrong and the\nmodel''s right name was ignored:\n\n- The name stands on the identifier line, between the quantity and the\n  identifiers (\"Stk. 25 ALPHA INDUSTRIES AG , WKN / ISIN: …\"); the\n  rules only looked above or below that line or after a label, and a\n  bare \"Wertpapier\" heads unrelated lines in the tax tables. The\n  identifier line is now read first.\n- No check reaches the name, so a disagreement went to the rules. Now the\n  text decides: the name printed nearer the ISIN/WKN wins; one the text\n  does not print at all loses; a tie stays with the rules.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n* Settlement reading: exchange fees after the fees'' total; no model Kurswert on tax papers\n\n- Variable Börsenspesen (and other third-party charges) printed after\n  the bank''s \"Summe Entgelte\" were left out of the fees, so a settlement\n  that showed them did not add up by exactly that amount and read as\n  unverified. Charges listed after the total are now added to it, and\n  \"(Variable) Börsenspesen\" counts as a fee line without a total too.\n- A tax statement or a notice of accumulated income prints no Kurswert,\n  price or charges. What the model reads there (a tax base, a per-share\n  amount) filled the gap and failed the equation check; it is dropped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw9H0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAA30QAG9xfMbjt