dcff02120a41e5f7f2e16decfc12ec","sha":"54c2575f70dcff02120a41e5f7f2e16decfc12ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/54c2575f70dcff02120a41e5f7f2e16decfc12ec"}],"sha":"981ee1f844c3c05770fcf1cd7d74fcd708c00c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/981ee1f844c3c05770fcf1cd7d74fcd708c00c86"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2434239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67","id":2434239,"login":"as19git67","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzQyMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/54c2575f70dcff02120a41e5f7f2e16decfc12ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:53:48Z","email":"anton@schegg.de","name":"as19git67"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:53:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Depot documents: accumulated income and the Vorabpauschale are a tax, not a dividend (#1451)\n\nA notice of income a fund kept (Thesaurierung, ausschüttungsgleiche\nErträge) was read as a dividend — \"ausschüttungsgleich\" contains\n\"Ausschüttung\" — and its tax charge booked as a payout with a positive\nsign. A Vorabpauschale''s tax statement was not read at all.\n\n- Parser: looksLikeAccumulation (the words, and no trade settlement or\n  payout credit note around them). Such a notice reads as the new kind\n  \"tax\": the tax charged, net negative, no gross, no price. Its words\n  are now candidates for reading in.\n- Kind \"tax\" in the depot transactions (API, manual entry): money out,\n  no shares moved. The portfolio counts it as negative income — income\n  is counted after taxes — and in the position''s taxes.\n- A notice without any tax charged books nothing.\n- The model saying \"no settlement\" no longer rejects such a notice.\n- Review: dividends already booked from such notices are listed under\n  \"Thesaurierung als Dividende gebucht\"; \"Korrigieren\" (after a\n  confirmation) turns one into the tax charged, or removes it when none\n  was. Nothing changes without the user asking.\n- Dialog: its own headline for such notices.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"478053717a0ea88689d514ff92bec10758571395","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/trees/478053717a0ea88689d514ff92bec10758571395"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/commits/54c2575f70dcff02120a41e5f7f2e16decfc12ec","verification":{"payload":"tree 478053717a0ea88689d514ff92bec10758571395\nparent 6c1bb8828efd38c18664cf457edfa96dbaffc365\nauthor as19git67 <anton@schegg.de> 1791212028 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791212028 +0200\n\nDepot documents: accumulated income and the Vorabpauschale are a tax, not a dividend (#1451)\n\nA notice of income a fund kept (Thesaurierung, ausschüttungsgleiche\nErträge) was read as a dividend — \"ausschüttungsgleich\" contains\n\"Ausschüttung\" — and its tax charge booked as a payout with a positive\nsign. A Vorabpauschale''s tax statement was not read at all.\n\n- Parser: looksLikeAccumulation (the words, and no trade settlement or\n  payout credit note around them). Such a notice reads as the new kind\n  \"tax\": the tax charged, net negative, no gross, no price. Its words\n  are now candidates for reading in.\n- Kind \"tax\" in the depot transactions (API, manual entry): money out,\n  no shares moved. The portfolio counts it as negative income — income\n  is counted after taxes — and in the position''s taxes.\n- A notice without any tax charged books nothing.\n- The model saying \"no settlement\" no longer rejects such a notice.\n- Review: dividends already booked from such notices are listed under\n  \"Thesaurierung als Dividende gebucht\"; \"Korrigieren\" (after a\n  confirmation) turns one into the tax charged, or removes it when none\n  was. Nothing changes without the user asking.\n- Dialog: its own headline for such notices.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw7n8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFVkQAADABf6zhhpk4w07V86d1Z7/\nusACiupVy0R4aaQaw/7t5MCSvFwilr377Hep4TudJCgY1K8jgDvQE8rQ0WT/Cz9M\n9b9UXevLufqv7DF/9FcoZsCKiQjmAJ4y3tHRNAYEyxwbufvtV8NvSESNBjn3Edng\nGH44NXlKyXT+F9wHKJKipSBPuAfLfRjRPGc3aWKWNESdkKElOmr3PBaFXJM4Shko\nJidQJFbzADS1iao9mFFtN97Q56+c4QXET4xSXFrl324zN45Dc0YzxZuXsFgPkMba\nLz6GNUSkAhCDmHdKJaUp35R0SZZNtuiIsvvN+M79yzEqMr9xNFnVShlSfNiGQsyi\n0japgxLEApFhO0hiEFyd2ubWWMquPhdvMSWkHYGv7oHnag1FydV5BwtWXDY+yaui\nNIPJRb9496R++1oS+56wEg5zKUtTtaS0gPyjA289jbf2GDi1Z1oEKbwSQmT+l0WP\nKpai0n0t5rc+5k5ihMew06/srwC4jCvcdH6EIn69armxZRQVlKG0rrq0fDkK0FJk\n1bFvxUdDAlRp9ifeqPMhlfaCtNcRjvYXCFz6LYf552VpOFpuO9Z2cWWH1ZnLzelY\nhE3fcNpL1fsAJggJ+F0rsSP2iMh/vqP8qNvVyp8oRAJ5Pd49oDT6BpT4juwGVtVv\nSDjQPko1jAphgOC0FCmx\n=Fl7B\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T14:53:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67/fk-encore/commit/54c2575f70dcff02120a41e5f7f2e16decfc12ec","node_id":"C_kwDORl_MVtoAKDU0YzI1NzVmNzBkY2ZmMDIxMjBhNDFlNWY3ZjJlMTZkZWNmYzEyZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67/fk-encore/commit/6c1bb8828efd38c18664cf457edfa96dbaffc365","sha":"6c1bb8828efd38c18664cf457edfa96dbaffc365","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/6c1bb8828efd38c18664cf457edfa96dbaffc365"}],"sha":"54c2575f70dcff02120a41e5f7f2e16decfc12ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/54c2575f70dcff02120a41e5f7f2e16decfc12ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2434239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67","id":2434239,"login":"as19git67","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzQyMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/6c1bb8828efd38c18664cf457edfa96dbaffc365/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:43:19Z","email":"anton@schegg.de","name":"as19git67"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:43:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Trip planner: a wished-for restaurant takes the meal block; the food list gets details and real buttons (#1452)\n\nFrom the device: a restaurant added via \"Ort suchen\" and hearted never\nshowed up on the day, and \"In diesen Block setzen\" from \"Essen in der\nNähe\" quietly failed. Both for one reason — a meal block refused every\nstop — and the solver, which picks no venue, treated the restaurant\nlike a museum for the sightseeing blocks.\n\n- A meal block takes somewhere to eat (food, cafe) and nothing else\n  (move.ts, MEAL_CATEGORIES); the block picker offers a restaurant the\n  meal blocks only, a café both kinds, a sight only the sightseeing\n  blocks (TripBlockTargets.fits).\n- The solver still picks no venue, but a restaurant somebody asked for\n  (votes.ts sets `wanted` on a heart or a net \"will ich\") goes into the\n  meal block on re-plan: one per meal, the best that the walk allows,\n  over budget shown rather than refused. On a day with a meal block a\n  restaurant goes into no sightseeing block; a café still can. Days\n  filled in later and re-planned on the spot learn who wanted what\n  through markWanted.\n- \"Essen in der Nähe\": the row opens the spot''s detail screen; the\n  actions are proper bordered buttons (44 pt, icon beside its word)\n  in a row that scrolls, \"In den Block\" prominent.\n\nBuild 1697. Docs: §10.3 addendum.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WSkPd5rVvryfTqbafCwo2n\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60fa458d91c258682a66421d6559c243da156437","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/trees/60fa458d91c258682a66421d6559c243da156437"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/commits/6c1bb8828efd38c18664cf457edfa96dbaffc365","verification":{"payload":"tree 60fa458d91c258682a66421d6559c243da156437\nparent c347198a83390d50a4163b0e280d4a442684be1b\nauthor as19git67 <anton@schegg.de> 1791211399 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791211399 +0200\n\nTrip planner: a wished-for restaurant takes the meal block; the food list gets details and real buttons (#1452)\n\nFrom the device: a restaurant added via \"Ort suchen\" and hearted never\nshowed up on the day, and \"In diesen Block setzen\" from \"Essen in der\nNähe\" quietly failed. Both for one reason — a meal block refused every\nstop — and the solver, which picks no venue, treated the restaurant\nlike a museum for the sightseeing blocks.\n\n- A meal block takes somewhere to eat (food, cafe) and nothing else\n  (move.ts, MEAL_CATEGORIES); the block picker offers a restaurant the\n  meal blocks only, a café both kinds, a sight only the sightseeing\n  blocks (TripBlockTargets.fits).\n- The solver still picks no venue, but a restaurant somebody asked for\n  (votes.ts sets `wanted` on a heart or a net \"will ich\") goes into the\n  meal block on re-plan: one per meal, the best that the walk allows,\n  over budget shown rather than refused. On a day with a meal block a\n  restaurant goes into no sightseeing block; a café still can. Days\n  filled in later and re-planned on the spot learn who wanted what\n  through markWanted.\n- \"Essen in der Nähe\": the row opens the spot''s detail screen; the\n  actions are proper bordered buttons (44 pt, icon beside its word)\n  in a row that scrolls, \"In den 