5ec4f9dcf33708604f80b0","sha":"52b9d7c7fe10c3ca625ec4f9dcf33708604f80b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/52b9d7c7fe10c3ca625ec4f9dcf33708604f80b0"}],"sha":"c28bb166ba334018d9396def9c99d83e5f571add","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/c28bb166ba334018d9396def9c99d83e5f571add"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2434239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67","id":2434239,"login":"as19git67","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzQyMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/52b9d7c7fe10c3ca625ec4f9dcf33708604f80b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:38:08Z","email":"anton@schegg.de","name":"as19git67"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:38:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Settlement merge: pick each disagreeing field from whichever source adds up (#1442)\n\nThe merge chose one whole reading — rules or model, each filled from the\nother. When the rules read the net right and the quantity wrong while the\nmodel did the opposite, each whole reading failed one check, the tie went\nto the rules, and a statement whose figures were all readable ended up\nunverified with the wrong quantity.\n\nNow every combination of the disagreeing fields is tried (up to 2^10) and\nthe one with the fewest failed checks wins, then the most passed, then the\nfewest values taken from the model — which also keeps fields no check\nreaches with the rules, as before.\n\nParser:\n- The security name prefers \"Wertpapier-Bezeichnung\"/\"Bezeichnung\"/\n  \"Gattung\" over a bare \"Wertpapier\", and reads the next line when the\n  label shares its line with the WKN/ISIN column heading.\n- \"Stückzinsen\" is no longer read as the quantity; \"St. 30\" is.\n\nDialog: a disagreeing row also says which label the rules read after.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aaeb96ba5f0a0edb904e4242fcb28af7c0e62ed0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/trees/aaeb96ba5f0a0edb904e4242fcb28af7c0e62ed0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/commits/52b9d7c7fe10c3ca625ec4f9dcf33708604f80b0","verification":{"payload":"tree aaeb96ba5f0a0edb904e4242fcb28af7c0e62ed0\nparent 2a2a2444e69a4fb87f1d936bdcaefd30acab1d9e\nauthor as19git67 <anton@schegg.de> 1791142688 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791142688 +0200\n\nSettlement merge: pick each disagreeing field from whichever source adds up (#1442)\n\nThe merge chose one whole reading — rules or model, each filled from the\nother. When the rules read the net right and the quantity wrong while the\nmodel did the opposite, each whole reading failed one check, the tie went\nto the rules, and a statement whose figures were all readable ended up\nunverified with the wrong quantity.\n\nNow every combination of the disagreeing fields is tried (up to 2^10) and\nthe one with the fewest failed checks wins, then the most passed, then the\nfewest values taken from the model — which also keeps fields no check\nreaches with the rules, as before.\n\nParser:\n- The security name prefers \"Wertpapier-Bezeichnung\"/\"Bezeichnung\"/\n  \"Gattung\" over a bare \"Wertpapier\", and reads the next line when the\n  label shares its line with the WKN/ISIN column heading.\n- \"Stückzinsen\" is no longer read as the quantity; \"St. 30\" is.\n\nDialog: a disagreeing row also says which label the rules read after.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DoEgs1Tx8wZyzVtNGNjhZm\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwqsgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoXIQAJcJ3mnKIZfsFM+dzdMZYHBO\nz0Afob2dKZpnIzTSUL3MYfkIKGib4JYHdhCgzEsTksyvTwbbtqJ2PGErUKHwxdvE\nTPBOp1hUzwU4ZRxPsUY9MlAWK0PYTHa7/v7Y59st/4tlCxPkgURYFZD3tCmBsVI2\ntjwwbpB9qgRtW1957o5GOEwf7Q+IeIe8weyiygaQ+PBFB9ocyh1HZqpw29zT9Bw0\ngw3ths+X9yjzvCXcjyzDbDVkk98zntiyoqW3l4PHSjl64GhjfaMZNNiNHrONa3mF\njxVy7N4CxOCXhAIXHwyNbeSPANFR+9KCHNtALPoDvmrSP5bdwKa/bNYzt/doSr62\nruQlxqnguBXrcAAHm6bKs78H4gN/x6B4aXABL2SpvHRla/9UOWivhTPWC4QJNBzN\njos5S+vzVRHAvgMowY/tAiHmq2l1ViO0tNEtZv+OeSjHS3uoTut7R115FAMsLpxc\nkRE9X9IFiikiGZ4OIN43a54ZZKhNzHgxYVNJu9arZ0OOjIQu/I24jSjmVk4tS2Ku\nqxC0kdtD+Mc7q7dYlP67etLN9lsg4Wfg4E6vRILH3OIgqFn8zO5i5XxUwtTn8HHN\nY4rUidZJ6+jCMwOaIOEe2ALEGppOLZrM4zhP/JDM82mWSSaCWjGy0U87BCJUQRqJ\nFq1CJmofsuixz63MYn0e\n=l4bl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T19:38:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/receive