67/fk-encore/commits/72921f59adbf5de199aeec492e703c47d82c75f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:08:50Z","email":"anton@schegg.de","name":"as19git67"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:08:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"iOS: scroll while selecting, and a collage that matches the web (#1417)\n\nSelection mode no longer freezes the photo grids: drag-to-select is a UIKit long-press recognizer, so a swipe scrolls and hold-then-drag selects.\n\nThe iOS collage now behaves like the web''s CollageDialog. Layouts are chosen from previews drawn with the photos, and the photos are rearranged by dragging one onto another. Sharing works, and saving adds the collage to the album it came from. It is reachable from the gallery too. The photos fill the cells in selection order, and the collage is dated after its newest source. The preview crops exactly like the export. The export is 4000 px at JPEG quality 0.92 with white seams, and captions get a free colour picker. The web export now draws from the original photos instead of the 1600 px previews.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016LiwkGCxsp2BNzCigrvHiH","tree":{"sha":"201aeaa1a1e8d1e7b6d39de717b1e9bfe82f3dc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/trees/201aeaa1a1e8d1e7b6d39de717b1e9bfe82f3dc8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/commits/72921f59adbf5de199aeec492e703c47d82c75f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","grava