vents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/as19git67","id":2434239,"login":"as19git67","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzQyMzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/as19git67","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/commits/abf9d665d0052bdbae30903f81dede5728e7f322/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:12:31Z","email":"anton@schegg.de","name":"as19git67"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:12:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Documents: the tax-review recompute cron iterates rows again (#1396)\n\nThe nightly job read the users with subject persons through\n`dbAll(db.execute(sql ...))`. With node-postgres a raw execute resolves to\na QueryResult object, not an array, so every run died on \"rows is not\niterable\" before touching a single person. The query is now a typed\nselectDistinct on user_subject_persons.\n\nA test runs the sweep against two users: a derived flag left stale is\ncorrected, an explicit override stays, a second sweep is quiet.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TzUSmLtnpEakztrMexTZWZ\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9fdf7b114de86e866966cb8554d17ae197dcd173","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/as19git67/fk-encore/git/trees/9fdf7b114de86e866966cb8554d17ae197dcd173"},"url":"https://ap