iderType":"User"},"email":"avi.engelstein@gmail.com","name":"mymac"},"authoredDate":"2026-05-13T12:35:08Z","committedDate":"2026-05-13T12:35:08Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"Avien","providerType":"User"},"email":"avi.engelstein@gmail.com","name":"mymac"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:11:45.201Z","repositoryId":1180806193,"sha":"94e23af14b0d4a9707b7e095b9e0e8ce6f794d48"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:11:45.201Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4569044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Avien","id":4569044,"login":"Avien","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NjkwNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avien/users-portal/commits/596dfc8bf08838ef45fccac662fba02553a4c44e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T09:52:11Z","email":"avi.engelstein@gmail.com","name":"Avi Engelshtein"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T09:52:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: improve portfolio reviewer and AI-scan readiness (#27)\n\n* docs: portfolio/reviewer readiness pass across README and deep dives\n\nRestructures the README for reviewer/AI-scan legibility (For Reviewers —\nStart Here, Capability → Evidence table, Architecture Decisions & Trade-offs,\nIntentional Demo Limitations) and fixes accumulated staleness: missing Vue\ncoverage in the library structure, framework isolation, local dev, available\ncommands, and testing sections; a stale Business Agent semantics claim in\ndocs/business-agent.md that contradicted the actual system prompt; the\nAgentic AI Development framing and PR-review required-check status in\ndocs/agentic-workflow.md; a broken pre-existing anchor in docs/state-flow.md;\nand several overclaimed/imprecise phrasings (facade \"same shape\", \"zero\ncross-framework coupling\", Hybrid local-dev port-conflicting instructions,\nper-command Vue/React/Angular scope) caught across multiple review passes.\ndocs/state-flow.md gains a full Vue facade section to match Angular/React.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(readme): trim repetitive top-of-README intro\n\nShortens the bullet-heavy intro to two sentences now that \"For Reviewers —\nStart Here\" is the real reviewer entry point, and removes the resulting\nduplicate architecture claim from Project Overview''s opening line.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update README.md\n\n* docs: make architecture highlights human-first\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b8ea344f02ca15ee94e92ff43be6af5ba4354db7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avien/users-portal/git/trees/b8ea344f02ca15ee94e92ff43be6af5ba4354db7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avien/users-portal/git/commits/596dfc8bf08838ef45fccac662fba02553a4c44e","verification":{"payload":"tree b8ea344f02ca15ee94e92ff43be6af5ba4354db7\nparent a3c8ffa0b2089dea29e35065b3c502c5f71db0de\nauthor Avi Engelshtein <avi.engelstein@gmail.com> 1788774731 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788774731 +0300\n\ndocs: improve portfolio reviewer and AI-scan readiness (#27)\n\n* docs: portfolio/reviewer readiness pass across README and deep dives\n\nRestructures the README for reviewer/AI-scan legibility (For Reviewers —\nStart Here, Capability → Evidence table, Architecture Decisions & Trade-offs,\nIntentional Demo Limitations) and fixes accumulated staleness: missing Vue\ncoverage in the library structure, framework isolation, local dev, available\ncommands, and testing sections; a stale Business Agent semantics claim in\ndocs/business-agent.md that contradicted the actual system prompt; the\nAgentic AI Development framing and PR-review required-check status in\ndocs/agentic-workflow.md; a broken pre-existing anchor in docs/state-flow.md;\nand several overclaimed/imprecise phrasings (facade \"same shape\", \"zero\ncross-framework coupling\", Hybrid local-dev port-conflicting instructions,\nper-command Vue/React/Angular scope) caught across multiple review passes.\ndocs/state-flow.md gains a full Vue facade section to match Angular/React.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(readme): trim repetitive top-of-README intro\n\nShortens the bullet-heavy intro to two sentences now that \"For Reviewers —\nStart Here\" is the real reviewer entry point, and removes the resulting\nduplicate architecture claim from Project Overview''s opening line.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update README.md\n\n* docs: make architecture highlights human-first\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnolLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbqMQAHFRyOxiMCvnFT3eI2cpZ0yk\n+xhsyhugu0OSGJPYcFOww8u4VQZjNtbi7Bcm+rn1c+LYYbUFqCXTvyRzB6ULfGlz\nlZF9pp0idRTWcG02gSnxrqE5VwdsgyhfMhXwvVHsKJ38EfrRpX9gctHXkYz09/Vx\n+NMLr8wXweiKr95dp8W48wUMjGnDWCoTm7HWppaQa/HzUJLyh9sO8Z8jM12rkm+v\nRBE1MLRQO5ip5vOFATfe/ZM5PlMg3PRfbr0gvY7zNoZ4+riAUcimzlZDI77A4/DJ\nVMlCWcabU4emCyIeSkIexLmmCcpdZLpZ1yXCwjo3VKB7+wFrPnCnSqa24Hnr3Otx\nu1RnQB5Sdw+BDU8tOJ6mYhs3wIfcOrQMNOKZxXNyOpB+l2tRtSHQvns5TbkRmh4C\nsxLVOm48gYl+s1iPCX6x8WNvu+wnOIATuJjxAED/Ixa2tmn5nsVlrUxjAhWMhSq1\nRppd8uQgDcKASd+fN0vkQ5XqZ1tJ