ps://api.github.com/users/Avien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Avien","id":4569044,"login":"Avien","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NjkwNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avien/users-portal/commits/cdd6d78f533bd8b1a052c50c0342d596607cab28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:54:04Z","email":"avi.engelstein@gmail.com","name":"mymac"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:54:04Z","email":"avi.engelstein@gmail.com","name":"mymac"},"message":"feat(vue): Phase 1 data-access — API fns, Pinia store, useOrdersStream composable\n\nMirrors libs/users-react/data-access, translated to Vue idioms:\n- api/{users,orders}.api.ts — plain async fns, framework-agnostic (copied verbatim)\n- store/users.store.ts — Zustand store -> Pinia setup store; notifications only,\n  module-scope dismissTimers Map + auto-dismiss (warning 10s / critical 20s)\n- stream/use-orders-stream.ts — React hook -> Vue composable: useQueryClient from\n  @tanstack/vue-query, one socket opened in onMounted, closure-held monitoring\n  state/buffer (setup runs once, no ref needed), cleanup in onScopeDispose;\n  module-scope pendingByUser + drainPendingOrders unchanged\n- specs: api (fake timers) + store (Pinia setActivePinia + auto-dismiss) — 5 tests green\n\nDeps: add pinia, @tanstack/vue-query.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb537580de3a3e80bf635975c826cb43939d598d","url":"https://api.github.com/re