,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avien/users-portal/commits/fd099f44f78d9a9a28a103d9eda91c50620fec56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T10:46:49Z","email":"avi.engelstein@gmail.com","name":"mymac"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T10:46:49Z","email":"avi.engelstein@gmail.com","name":"mymac"},"message":"feat(agent): add autonomous Claude API agent for scaffolding feature domains\n\nA from-scratch Claude API agent (tools/agent.mjs) that takes a natural-language\ngoal and scaffolds + fully wires a new dual-framework feature domain end to end.\nHand-rolled tool-use loop on claude-opus-4-8 with adaptive thinking; exposes this\nrepo''s own operations as tools (the feature-domain generator, file read/write/edit,\nthe validate scripts). Loads CLAUDE.md verbatim as the system prompt so the same\nrules that govern Claude Code drive the autonomous loop.\n\n- Manual model→tool→result loop, repo-confined file ops, approval gate (--yes to skip)\n- Spawns nx commands with NX_DAEMON=false so a stale daemon graph can''t hide\n  freshly-generated projects\n- Adds @anthropic-ai/sdk dependency, `npm run agent` script, .env gitignore rule,\n  and a README \"Autonomous Agent\" section\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a84c2a7cad0554b464917d92254b16aa4cc05c74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avien/users-portal/git/trees/a84c2a7cad0554b464917d92254b16aa4cc05c74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avien/users-portal/git/commits/fd099f44f78d9a9a28a103d9eda91c50620fec56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature"