ontract, vm, mock data)\n  libs/<name>-angular/data-access/    ← NgRx actions/reducer/effects/selectors + Signals facade\n  libs/<name>-react/data-access/      ← TanStack Query API fn + Zustand store\n  libs/<name>-react/feature/          ← useXxxFacade hook\n\nAlso updates tsconfig.base.json with all 4 path aliases automatically.\n\nAdapted from workplace NgRx generator — Angular side modernized to standalone +\ninject() + Angular Signals; React side new (TanStack Query + Zustand + hook facade).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb0a20901a290eac35605957eb600ebfe7a066f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avien/users-portal/git/trees/bb0a20901a290eac35605957eb600ebfe7a066f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avien/users-portal/git/commits/1fc93117783e667291e580662147780177467d02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4569044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Avien","id":4569044,"login":"Avien","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NjkwNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avien/users-portal/commit/1fc93117783e667291e580662147780177467d02","node_id":"C_kwDORmGsMdoAKDFmYzkzMTE3NzgzZTY2NzI5