ymac"},"message":"fix(ws): send 3 burst orders to account for the learning tick\n\nThe monitoring reducer swallows the first WS order as a learning tick\n(baseline snapshot). We need 3 rapid orders: the first is silently consumed,\nthe second (>=500) triggers the high-value warning, the third triggers\nthe burst/critical toast.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bd31be097c23588608171f2dbe897247863f058","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avien/users-portal/git/trees/1bd31be097c23588608171f2dbe897247863f058"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Avien/users-portal/git/commits/57fd07bb8e20c3920693ea8aba6bf30888ff69c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4569044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Avien","id":4569044,"login":"Avien","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NjkwNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avien","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Avien/users-portal/commit/57fd07bb8e20c3920693ea8aba6bf30888ff69c1","node_id":"C_kwDORmGsMdoAKDU3ZmQwN2JiOGUyMGMzOTIwNjkzZWE4YWJhNmJmMzA4ODhmZjY5YzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Avien/users-portal/commit/68637844ff0bf1f39e34f864b7d3e4671ed71af0","sha":"68637844ff0bf1f39e34f