ydın"},"message":"feat: initial MFE POC with Vite Module Federation\n\n- app-shell (port 5000): host with React Router, Lazy Loading, Suspense,\n  ErrorBoundary, Event Bus listener, and authStore integration\n- auth-remote (port 5001): exposes UserStatus component and authStore\n  plain-JS module via Module Federation\n- widget-remote (port 5002): exposes Widget component that fires\n  widget:ping CustomEvent for cross-module communication\n- Shared singleton React across all three apps\n- Resilience demo: ErrorBoundary catches widget-remote offline state\n- Comprehensive inline comments for learning purposes","tree":{"sha":"e652e164c52a3730aa6f4528b60caaaae9724450","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nesibeay/microfrontend-poc/git/trees/e652e164c52a3730aa6f4528b60caaaae9724450"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nesibeay/microfrontend-poc/git/commits/f62b770471b48a61226f640828e0b55f38ff6f22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nesibeay/microfrontend-poc/commit/f62b770471b48a61226f640828e0b55f38ff6f22","node_id":"C_kwDORmIWJ9oAKGY2MmI3NzA0NzFiNDhhNjEyMjZmNjQwODI4ZTBiNTVmMzhmZjZmMjI","parents":[],"sha":"f62b770471b48a61226f640828e0b55f38ff6f22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nesibeay/microfrontend-poc/commits/f62b770471b48a61226f640828e0b55f38ff6f22"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/nesibeay/microfrontend-poc/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=3c853449e96d9aedfc40a2b360bc0241579dbf42&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A41%3A43.457Z"}');
