"node_id":"C_kwDORmZa3doAKDdlMDc2YTBiZjFiYzU0MjhhZWMyZTRkZmIwMDA0YzdjNjkyZjE5N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nano-agent-team/hub/commit/cec686066606268983298e02c8488d27cc357605","sha":"cec686066606268983298e02c8488d27cc357605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/commits/cec686066606268983298e02c8488d27cc357605"}],"sha":"7e076a0bf1bc5428aec2e4dfb0004c7c692f197f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/commits/7e076a0bf1bc5428aec2e4dfb0004c7c692f197f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5829155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rpridal","id":5829155,"login":"rpridal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjkxNTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/commits/cec686066606268983298e02c8488d27cc357605/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T13:06:05Z","email":"rpridal@gmail.com","name":"Rostislav Přidal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T13:06:05Z","email":"rpridal@gmail.com","name":"Rostislav Přidal"},"message":"feat: flat agent architecture — all agents moved to hub/agents/\n\nRestructure hub to flat agent architecture as described in plan:\n- Move all nested agents from teams/*/agents/ → hub/agents/ (flat)\n- teams/ now contain only team.json + workflow.json (references, not ownership)\n\nNew agents:\n- foreman: system setup + project onboarding (replaces core settings agent)\n- workspace-provider: deterministic clone + branch (holds SSH/GH_TOKEN)\n- committer: deterministic git commit + push + PR (holds SSH/GH_TOKEN)\n- login-provider: deterministic browser session auth via Playwright\n- e2e-tester: Playwright-based browser testing (no secrets)\n- settings: moved from core to hub (optional, available for install)\n\nModified:\n- developer: removed ssh_mount + direct git, delegates to committer\n- developer CLAUDE.md: publishes topic.dev.done, not topic.pr.opened\n- dev-team workflow: PM → Workspace Provider → Architect → Developer → Reviewer → Committer\n- github-team workflow: developer publishes topic.dev.done, committer handles push+PR\n\nSecurity model: only deterministic agents hold secrets (SSH, GH_TOKEN).\nLLM agents (developer, architect, reviewer) have no access to secrets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7885d260d3d028803b5a701ddde9428848c9410a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/git/trees/7885d260d3d028803b5a701ddde9428848c9410a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/git/commits/cec686066606268983298e02c8488d27cc357605","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5829155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rpridal","id":5829155,"login":"rpridal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjkxNTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nano-agent-team/hub/commit/cec686066606268983298e02c8488d27cc357605","node_id":"C_kwDORmZa3doAKGNlYzY4NjA2NjYwNjI2ODk4MzI5OGUwMmM4NDg4ZDI3Y2MzNTc2MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nano-agent-team/hub/commit/93a5cf64ae056963b73450b1ec6270adaeb9ab87","sha":"93a5cf64ae056963b73450b1ec6270adaeb9ab87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/commits/93a5cf64ae056963b73450b1ec6270adaeb9ab87"}],"sha":"cec686066606268983298e02c8488d27cc357605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/commits/cec686066606268983298e02c8488d27cc357605"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5829155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rpridal","id":5829155,"login":"rpridal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjkxNTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/commits/af2590eae9f98a6ef1e44a0fc1b9eb4fa29ab8f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T11:27:09Z","email":"rpridal@gmail.com","name":"Rostislav Přidal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T11:27:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add Agent Creator standalone agent (#12)\n\n* feat: add Agent Creator standalone agent\n\nConversational agent that creates and modifies agents from natural\nlanguage descriptions. Generates manifest.json, CLAUDE.md, and\noptional Dockerfile, then builds the Docker image via management tools.\n\nSupports both creating new agents and extending existing ones.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(agent-creator): drop broken pip-search, keep only jq\n\npip-search relies on a deprecated PyPI XML-RPC endpoint that has been\nbroken since ~2021 — the silent || true masked the failure. python3 +\npip added ~150MB for no working tool. WebFetch against pypi.org covers\nany package research needs.\n\nKeep jq — genuinely useful for inspecting JSON manifests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"086ef8ee4ccd88fa8c58c00b6efcb1beeadbd5fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/git/trees/086ef8ee4ccd88fa8c58c00b6efcb1beeadbd5fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/git/commits/af2590eae9f98a6ef1e44a0fc1b9eb4fa29ab8f8","verification":{"payload":"tree 086ef8ee4ccd88fa8c58c00b6efcb1beeadbd5fa\nparent c1a9e4caff82dcd84341f10c9067aa3c21034129\nauthor Rostislav Přidal <rpridal@gmail.com> 1773919629 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773919629 +0100\n\nfeat: add Agent Creator standalone agent (#12)\n\n* feat: add Agent Creator standalone agent\n\nConversational agent that creates and modifies agents from natural\nlanguage descriptions. Generates manifest.json, CLAUDE.md, and\noptional Dockerfile, then builds the Docker image via management tools.\n\nSupports both creating new agents and extending existing ones.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(agent-creator): drop broken pip-search, keep only jq\n\npip-search relies on a deprecated PyPI XML-RPC endpoint that has been\nbroken since ~2021 — the silent || true masked the failure. python3 +\npip added ~150MB for no working tool. WebFetch against pypi.org covers\nany package research needs.\n\nKeep jq — genuinely useful for inspecting JSON manifests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpu92NCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuXwQADFp95Ne9SqClsYhbKTD8MWL\n1zohlVjKJONxN2diDnZhDJjgJyOhY1XYT+fJW9CHqcCiaGk+BFkmkVpar/Pm/ga3\nIEoa1GFEp4n/6BogOIG4KVMckuFjfiGUvReT6D5mP7nYQKwnHvBXzr0dXGSOZFsp\n1QXifwRyFvGTOmeMdgJZs+rgqRi6pZpoHr1VZBeIx4EgSy5Iy55XQZNcwkxHBC76\nIhuquTe71MwERhUW/53dHqnBUeTqvEt6vrwU/ha+ObmRK4bsykNjxzi4JnS0WPDj\n0H+Hn2t0WkUP/DlmDQ1PvQMdag/jnPtfAcOkNDryz1iKnx2mMU/wP99vNYiJQFlH\ngVxMM5LS9sUPt/zqCncVM0CgrDCAUFuyqSvAPEuvjDBaULNwyWQ23m2ayBz9mjTK\nH8rzL8pgFJhSGJ2xWtadDesvz24JcfgOk7y1v24p/GFVQ5ZG9FKicaLQb9XBMZZX\n38LDNe2VDqbgukbuW4u+AbakM/nXOkzsOQH+v36C42HG9Qw9x5efQVYgOZPEIvwB\nmyYojWXamMZa3BzF5ZrtjIYqLVrY0WXBxCmD25n5V6TZ2YHeiS3sLytr0RTwPpVA\nWEqod4cmGvXhYuFGFo1LxIsg8OuPy3MaU50LZAU2c/GB8ZQOMqDkQGouggEKMZ+7\n/hz+AyXZUDHtN3Ez6B6R\n=bonA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-19T11:27:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":