ing newlines\n\n- workflow.json: change developer binding \"to\": \"task\" → \"to\": \"event\"\n  to match manifest.json entrypoints [\"inbox\", \"event\"]; \"task\" is not\n  a declared entrypoint so messages would have been silently dropped\n- Add trailing newline to 9 manifest files (dev-team: architect,\n  developer, pm, scrum-master, tester; github-team: developer,\n  discussion-facilitator, pr-reviewer, vision-keeper)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3fb260d2b07a01bfb045492d9cb5cd90b20b377","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/git/trees/a3fb260d2b07a01bfb045492d9cb5cd90b20b377"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/git/commits/457a2663b1943abad57744d7c5a8ff2ac1b64049","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5829155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rpridal","id":5829155,"login":"rpridal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjkxNTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nano-agent-team/hub/commit/457a2663b1943abad57744d7c5a8ff2ac1b64049","node_id":"C_kwDORmZa3doAKDQ1N2EyNjYzYjE5NDNhYmFkNTc3NDRkN2M1YThmZjJhYzFiNjQwNDk","parents":[{"h