i.github.com/users/rpridal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rpridal","id":5829155,"login":"rpridal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjkxNTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/commits/b46b676a2f866cd83d6e5ac37da4515ffc558548/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T21:10:35Z","email":"rpridal@gmail.com","name":"Rostislav Přidal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T21:10:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(dev-team): add Product Owner agent + translate to English (#9)\n\n* fix(github-team): skip merged/closed PRs in poller\n\nAdd merged_at field to GitHubPR interface and explicitly skip PRs where\nstate !== ''open'' or merged_at !== null. Prevents the poller from emitting\nreview events for already-merged PRs due to stale GitHub API responses\nor merge commits pushing past the last bot activity timestamp.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(dev-team): add Product Owner agent + translate all agent files to English\n\n- Add product-owner agent: triages GitHub issues reported by other agents\n  - Subscribes to topic.issue.report and agent.product-owner.inbox\n  - Deduplicates against existing GitHub issues (semantic search)\n  - Creates new issues or adds comments to existing ones\n  - Publishes topic.issue.triaged on completion\n- Translate all dev-team agent CLAUDE.md files to English (pm, architect,\n  developer, tester, reviewer, scrum-master)\n- Translate all manifest.json descriptions to English\n- Add \"Reporting Issues to Product Owner\" section to developer, tester,\n  and reviewer agents with topic.issue.report payload format\n- Add missing repo fallback in PO agent (error reply when GITHUB_REPO unset)\n- Add issue_report and issue_triaged topics to team.json pipeline\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(dev-team): translate team.json description to English, add Product Owner\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed2d56efa5ff76b741ed8ac44dd500fa6418deb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/git/trees/ed2d56efa5ff76b741ed8ac44dd500fa6418deb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/git/commits/b46b676a2f866cd83d6e5ac37da4515ffc558548","verification":{"payload":"tree ed2d56efa5ff76b741ed8ac44dd500fa6418deb7\nparent 3697f60e892a0bd51d146364269f49a08487a3ab\nauthor Rostislav Přidal <rpridal@gmail.com> 1773781835 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773781835 +0100\n\nfeat(dev-team): add Product Owner agent + translate to English (#9)\n\n* fix(github-team): skip merged/closed PRs in poller\n\nAdd merged_at field to GitHubPR interface and explicitly skip PRs where\nstate !== ''open'' or merged_at !== null. Prevents the poller from emitting\nreview events for already-merged PRs due to stale GitHub API responses\nor merge commits pushing past the last bot activity timestamp.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(dev-team): add Product Owner agent + translate all agent files to English\n\n- Add product-owner agent: triages GitHub issues reported by other agents\n  - Subscribes to topic.issue.report and agent.product-owner.inbox\n  - Deduplicates against existing GitHub issues (semantic search)\n  - Creates new issues or adds comments to existing ones\n  - Publishes topic.issue.triaged on completion\n- Translate all dev-team agent CLAUDE.md files to English (pm, architect,\n  developer, tester, reviewer, scrum-master)\n- Translate all manifest.json descriptions to English\n- Add \"Reporting Issues to Product Owner\" section to developer, tester,\n  and reviewer agents with topic.issue.report payload format\n- Add missing repo fallback in PO agent (error reply when GITHUB_REPO unset)\n- Add issue_report and issue_triaged topics to team.json pipeline\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(dev-team): translate team.json description to English, add Product Owner\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpucNLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALFwQAFhPhuHUI4Qz1EA7QJ6JDCtd\nWfOrw6gb1L2FmUte6jytUrbL+a6cWjX0/dEwWpZQ7Kp3zRbOV7NYXdcR5fZJcDRx\neozFceGSTAqdhpTbXeCB63Deup4+1W2baxzH7MoLgbVoZvNi0XrH0pDkgiWlXM0g\nlnNmWZdmqAIuhavHX5M77ApINsGcotkdyjtyji+JcC2H1boALmMZRdRaXc7cgqVb\nvdT0fO2X1lM4gC+8UDZFLndpDoFsYHNSMhSa8iaCZXFvv+O9NcnSeyVcue1FyEy5\nAQhXcvBRUuH4hqmry8C9xOBKcsT+BTG60fnR/jws92eli9aZFj37xqbCxcibrQFt\nyd6y7I6YfhTQy7qAv08GNHhB/WqkOb0M5nM2LTTbEM+AOuq0YQyGzpGpyB920NBR\ns8RO/ifPLPhcbKayrzwKwLInUHIWW4rephZkrfmmHmXr7JzsTlhIOiWivm1WPZta\nN5vGworzi/MW1bOOJUVh3qmje7Ha7XN9ptqC4GeVy+RrptBtUIrZ2OTfj2BWRyF4\nDmJNAZhscYFvl9b8OTXU2tRyVuthcfI4KIeHkTxxODkbHsnS0+Lajp8LOW0qKWMQ\n8yzepsdA/TVTw+SmdumpJ3LJld5PC+g29zoZZP85MxvmmV1g0muB6Tvbaqph8ZTV\nn2mJ8t/eUjL7zvWlJAqo\n=mcyH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-17T21:10:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_