/rpridal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/commits/7ba4d0d83aa0e04e38221d64040e5fd85baf1565/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T13:04:14Z","email":"rpridal@gmail.com","name":"Rostislav Přidal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T13:04:14Z","email":"rpridal@gmail.com","name":"Rostislav Přidal"},"message":"feat(github-team): stateless PR polling — use GitHub as source of truth\n\nInstead of tracking last-seen timestamps locally, each poll cycle checks\nall open PRs against their actual review history on GitHub:\n- No bot comment on PR → fire pr.opened (review needed)\n- New commits since last bot comment → fire pr.synchronized\n- Already reviewed at latest commit → skip\n\nSurvives restarts and reinstalls without losing state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4a558c53a63320fb0b0c7dee5207083a04dd295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/git/trees/f4a558c53a63320fb0b0c7dee5207083a04dd295"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/hub/git/commits/7ba4d0d83aa0e04e38221d64040e5fd85baf1565","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5829155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rpridal","id":5829155,"login":"rpridal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjkxNTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpridal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/user