odel: agents declare capabilities (file_read, shell, web)\n  mapped to SDK tools by agent-runner. Default = no tools.\n- Layer separation: dispatcher → strategist → consciousness (no skip-level)\n- Core-hub migration (7 base agents + constitution + shards)\n- dispatch_task injects _replyTo + _dispatchedBy for targeted replies\n\nDashboard:\n- Agent detail panel: right side, resizable (drag left edge)\n- Mind map: task files from Obsidian with status + assignee + expandable content\n- Show completed checkbox fix (filters plans + tasks)\n- Human-readable activity labels (18 MCP + 10 builtin mappings)\n- Rich activity stream: inputPreview for tools, LLM text streaming (2s debounce)\n\nAgent-runner:\n- canUseTool callback captures tool inputs for activity stream\n- Always sends targeted reply on _replyTo after processing\n- CAPABILITY_MAP: file_read, file_write, shell, web → SDK tools","tree":{"sha":"364e08aa7b2f7d8987c3a395d3e9adda1b3cd416","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/nano-agent-team/git/trees/364e08aa7b2f7d8987c3a395d3e9adda1b3cd416"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/nano-agent-team/git/commits/b31f0696ebfca0c5af85c26eb84db3e24367dfb4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nano-agent-team/nano-agent-team/commit/b31f0696ebfca0c5af85c26eb84db3e24367dfb4","node_id":"C_kwDORmb5XtoAKGIzMWYwNjk2ZWJmY2EwYzVhZjg1YzI2ZWI4NGRiM2UyNDM2N2RmYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nano-agent-team/nano-agent-team/commit/aec5d932b3c1507f447bc001c1168e7e4f482cc0","sha":"aec5d932b3c1507f447bc001c1168e7e4f482cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/nano-agent-team/commits/aec5d932b3c1507f447bc001c1168e7e4f482cc0"}],"sha":"b31f0696ebfca0c5af85c26eb84db3e24367dfb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nano-agent-team/nano-agent-team/commits/b31f0696ebfca0c5af85c26eb84db3e24367dfb4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"ht